{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9397a1d5b8e3e86012523981a05e6b5146cf879aa713b800c62b11431b05a3ff","ja":"みんなの予想","zh":"大家的预测","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"653dd9171b27536faa69a78d216dde9fa733e40665e976d2f8ed8fe6b401f308","ja":"「それではさっそく、皆さんに\nランキングを予想していってもらいましょう！」","zh":"“那么接下来，就请大家来预测一下排行榜吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"804c9b663ff83391f20e638a666b556c9db66785a746c1ce648b6c8e62614738","ja":"まずは10位からだね。\nみんなは、どのお風呂グッズが10位だと思う？","zh":"首先从第10名开始吧。\n大家觉得哪件浴室用品是第10名？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a3f7af386332ef81e7f6946094aa053c99d327324041e7395172d2fcf2e089b1","ja":"すっごく迷ったんだけど……\nちゃんと選んできたよ！","zh":"虽然特别纠结……但我还是好好选好了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9c42f4e91d7c28568b7b53e902f86679defd4dae8bce50887794ece17e2e622a","ja":"私はこれ！　ドライシャンプーシート！\n理由はー……なんとなく！","zh":"我要这个！免洗洗发水湿巾！\n理由嘛——就是觉得应该是这个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a47994a4a2db096af46442fac1c03830addc2401f8c18ba15a376b176961c262","ja":"つまりカンということですか？\nそんな適当な……確かに良いグッズでしたが。","zh":"也就是说，凭的是直觉吗？\n也太随便了吧……不过，确实是很不错的周边。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"dbb4777001830a39daf9fc4f175ce26d10fc202c1982a635621dc9c92388a15b","ja":"私は、こちらのバスピローを10位に予想しました。\nついうとうとしてしまうほど、使い心地がよくて。","zh":"我预测这款浴枕会排在第10名。\n使用起来特别舒服，不知不觉就打起了瞌睡。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"db1da579f01df78706320d20a2351d0aef049ea62af6590820684c640c173dc7","ja":"私は遊べる入浴剤です！　溶かしたら、\nお湯で壁に絵が書けるようになるんですよ！","zh":"我是可以玩的入浴剂！　溶解后，\n就能用热水在墙上画画了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bf790347461444f9827c2eeb9a61cfa0e1d5d762316b85262f0d75124f5a8cb2","ja":"すっごく楽しくて、\n私、お風呂でのぼせちゃうくらい遊んじゃいました♪","zh":"特别开心，我玩到在浴室里都泡晕了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c5cdccf5f12d56194517fd184e3ad18dd0720f8cfb24e9cb9dc798852e666d37","ja":"わかる～！　でも、シュワシュワ～って溶けて、\n中からオモチャが出てくるのも、面白かったよね！","zh":"我懂～！不过，像气泡一样滋滋溶化，然后从里面冒出玩具，也很有趣呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"25ce1f2f4abcf35383259cddb9281422d87dedd91930751dc794889338dfba6b","ja":"みんなバラバラだね！　ちなみに杏奈は、\nバスタブトレーだよ！　スマホが見やすかったから♪","zh":"大家都不一样呢！顺便一提，杏奈选的是浴缸托盘哦！因为看手机很方便♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"2e9f88e1fbe76a37fcf19ffe95cd35b2a21fbf2715d3a06edef9dc04a793137f","ja":"というわけで、答えも出そろったことだし、\n正解を見てみよ！　ジャ～～ン！","zh":"那么，答案也都齐了，\n来看看正确答案吧！锵～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"13afe0b2ae618a7d9f82b592b871cb71ad46ee45aeb118318df5b35f6fc526a8","ja":"あれぇ！？　全員ハズレ！？","zh":"咦！？　全员都没抽中！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"ab1d495f772d8161d6fd5769ff6c8e5f0c1049858d055824c78a2d8993ba14d8","ja":"誰かは当たると思ったのですが……。\nランキング予想、思ったより難しいですね……。","zh":"我还以为总会有人猜中的……  \n排行榜预测比想象中更难呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"fc1ce4e169dc17cc79b48665e2fdfe29d96384e4854c8c20050597b8fc4291ef","ja":"でもでも、まだ10位ですから！\nここからどんどん当てていけばいいんですよ！","zh":"不过不过，现在还只是第10名呢！\n接下来只要不断猜中就行了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"f2e276f4c50a310bf078bd40a4e6d1d4efa37e9af89710086e07a3c2fa619734","ja":"その後、誰も正解を当てられないまま\nランキング発表は進んでいき……","zh":"之后，谁都没能猜中正确答案，排行榜公布就这样继续进行着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"12b0815ebccff00aa94afdaf4c358e39a56326778ee810f2d1c3eb116925d8ab","ja":"うう……あと1問、なんだよね……？","zh":"呜呜……还剩1道题，对吧……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1805.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"0c4b5e2bcbce56b30135dca9b7590fbe8bcb1e45ae63a1c751771a5c3bd56080","ja":"最後くらい、正解させなきゃ！","zh":"至少最后一次，得答对才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
